1
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:12,550
Mr. Chen: Excuse me, sir. Good morning.

2
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:16,200
Papa Fiston: Good morning, my friend! Welcome!

3
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:22,810
Mr. Chen: Thank you. I am looking for Zando. Where is Zando market?

4
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:30,670
Papa Fiston: Zando? Easy! It is in Limete. Take a bus to Matete. Go straight, then turn right.

5
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:37,860
Mr. Chen: Limete... a bus to Matete... OK. Is it far?

6
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:43,200
Papa Fiston: No, no. It is very near. Twenty minutes.

7
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:51,700
Grace: Excuse me. Sorry, Papa. That is not correct.

8
00:00:52,900 --> 00:00:54,800
Papa Fiston: Not correct? Why?

9
00:00:55,800 --> 00:01:01,620
Grace: Zando is not in Limete. Zando is in Gombe. It is in the city centre.

10
00:01:02,900 --> 00:01:05,590
Mr. Chen: In Gombe? Not in Limete?

11
00:01:06,300 --> 00:01:14,700
Grace: Yes. Gombe. Take a taxi-bus. The driver says "Zando! Zando!". You get in. It is easy.

12
00:01:14,900 --> 00:01:16,300
Conductor: Zando! Zando!

13
00:01:17,300 --> 00:01:20,200
Mr. Chen: How much is the bus?

14
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:24,800
Grace: It is cheap. Have small money with you.

15
00:01:25,800 --> 00:01:31,200
Papa Fiston: Ah! Sorry, sorry! Limete is a different market. My mistake!

16
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:38,100
Mr. Chen: No problem. Thank you, sir. And thank you very much, miss.

17
00:01:38,300 --> 00:01:43,700
Grace: You're welcome. Come, the bus stop is here. Follow me.

18
00:01:44,800 --> 00:01:46,700
Mr. Chen: Great! Goodbye, sir!

19
00:01:46,900 --> 00:01:49,930
Papa Fiston: Goodbye! Welcome to Kinshasa!

